  "content": "<h2>内容：</h2><p>修改机械动力模组，使其在机器上显示整组物品而非仅1-4个</p><p>仅客户端修改，需机械动力6.0及以上版本</p><h3>传送带：</h3><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6a6a6922-a97c-4a3b-97cf-c8c79638ea3a.png\" alt=\"图片\"></p><h3>仓储：</h3><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6cd3501e-388e-4c4c-8dcd-13e5af8ba18c.png\" alt=\"图片\"></p><h3>传送带上的方块：</h3><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fa1dc212-1e74-407f-8abe-d63b42e5b85e.png\" alt=\"图片\"></p><h3>机械臂：</h3><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1449195/description_cc1abe6f-dab1-428a-84a6-b62554fb4bfd.png\" alt=\"图片\"></p><h3>盆：</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/27453e95fac1adefdb136cc24531e8c9b31102a1_0.webp\" alt=\"请替换此描述\"></p>",
